detaileddescription.para:
Usage example: //Openamusicfromanaudiofile
sf::Musicmusic("music.ogg");

//Changesomeparameters
music.setPosition({0,1,10});//changeits3Dposition
music.setPitch(2);//increasethepitch
music.setVolume(50);//reducethevolume
music.setLooping(true);//makeitloop

//Playit
music.play();
